      en: ["Nikopol is situated about 50 km southwest of Zaporizhzhia on the Dnieper", "The famous Scythian gold of Chertomlyk was discovered nearby in 1863", "The city was established in 1782 on the site of a former Cossack post", "It is home to one of the world's largest ferroalloy production plants", "The Kakhovka Reservoir creates a water surface several kilometers wide here", "Bohdan Khmelnytskyi's uprising began at this location in 1648"],
