      en: ["Sloviansk was founded in 1676 as the border fortress of Tor", "The city is famous for the healing salt lakes Ropne and Slipne", "The first health resort facility was opened here in 1827", "It is home to over 200 businesses in the ceramics industry", "The name was changed from Tor to Sloviansk in 1784", "The city is located on the strategic Kharkiv-Rostov railway line"],
