      en: ["Ukraine's first coal mine was opened here in 1795", "The name Lysychansk is derived from the word 'lysa' (fox)", "Belgian investors constructed over 30 buildings in the city in the late 19th century", "Ernest Solvay opened the Donetsk Soda Factory here in 1892", "Lysychansk forms an urban agglomeration with Sievierodonetsk and Rubizhne", "Lysychansk Gymnasium was recognized for its unique Belgian cultural heritage"],
