      en: ["Berdychiv was first mentioned in official records in 1430.", "The Monastery of the Discalced Carmelites was founded in 1627.", "Honoré de Balzac married Ewelina Hańska at St. Barbara's Church in 1850.", "Joseph Conrad, author of 'Heart of Darkness,' was born nearby in 1857.", "Before World War II, over 80% of the city's inhabitants were Jewish.", "The city is located on the Hnylopyat River in the historical region of Podillia."],
      es: ["Primera mención en 1430.", "La iglesia carmelita se completó en 1754.", "Población en 2021: aprox. 75.000.", "Joseph Conrad nació en Berdychiv el 3 de diciembre de 1857.", "La ciudad está situada en el río Hnylopiat, a 42 km al suroeste de Zhytomyr.", "En el siglo XIX, Berdychiv era el segundo mercado más grande de Ucrania después de Kiev."],
      pt: ["Primeira menção em 1430.", "A Igreja Carmelita foi concluída em 1754.", "População em 2021: aprox. 75.000.", "Joseph Conrad nasceu em Berdychiv a 3 de dezembro de 1857.", "A cidade situa-se no rio Hnylopiat, 42 km a sudoeste de Zhytomyr.", "No século XIX, Berdychiv era o segundo maior mercado da Ucrânia após Kiev."],
