      en: ["The St. Nicholas Cathedral was built in 1658 to celebrate unity with the Cossack state.", "Nikolai Gogol spent seven formative years studying at the local higher gymnasium.", "The city features a monument dedicated to the Nizhyn cucumber, unveiled in 2005.", "The Greek community maintained its own schools and judicial system in the 18th century.", "The city is home to over 20 historically significant churches and monasteries.", "During the 19th century, Nizhyn was a leading center for book printing in the region."],
