      en: ["Pryluky was first mentioned in chronicles in 1085", "The city was the seat of a Cossack regiment in the 17th century", "The Transfiguration Cathedral was built in 1720 in Baroque style", "The tobacco factory in the city was founded back in 1889", "The city is located at a junction of important railway lines", "Pryluky has a current population of approximately 53,000"],
