      en: ["The city was established in 1973 specifically for the Rivne NPP workers.", "Until the year 2016, the city was officially known as Kuznetsovsk.", "The Rivne Nuclear Power Plant operates four nuclear reactors at the site.", "Varash covers an area of approximately 11.3 square kilometers along the Styr River.", "The city's population is currently estimated at around 42,000 people.", "The Styr River flows along the eastern boundary of the municipal area."],
