      en: ["Morshyn was first mentioned in historical documents in the year 1482.", "The official spa resort status was established in 1878 by Bonifacy Stiller.", "Spring No. 6 is famous for its high magnesium and sulfate content.", "The town is situated at an altitude of approximately 340 meters above sea level.", "Morshyn has a permanent population of roughly 6,000 residents.", "The local mineral water is one of the most popular bottled waters in Ukraine."],
      es: ["Morshyn obtuvo el estatus de balneario en 1867", "Las fuentes de agua mineral tienen un caudal total de 500.000 litros por día", "La ciudad tiene una superficie de unos 5 km²", "La población es de unos 6.000 (2021)", "La fuente más alta está a 350 m de altitud", "Morshyn se encuentra a 10 km al este de Truskavets"],
