      en: ["The first recorded mention of Truskavets dates back to the year 1469.", "The resort was officially founded in 1827 with the opening of sulfur baths.", "The name 'Naftusia' is derived from the word for petroleum, due to its taste.", "Truskavets is situated in a scenic valley at 350 meters above sea level.", "The town has a population of 28,000, but hosts many more tourists annually.", "The central resort park features numerous unique mineral water springs."],
