      en: ["The city was established in 1954 as a settlement for port construction workers.", "The Port of Chornomorsk is among the top three busiest seaports in Ukraine.", "In 2016, the city was officially renamed Chornomorsk from its former name.", "Chornomorsk is located roughly 20 kilometers south of the city of Odesa.", "Its municipal beach has held the Blue Flag status continuously since 2011.", "The current population of Chornomorsk is approximately 58,000 residents."],
