      en: ["Kaniv was first recorded in historical chronicles in the year 1144.", "Taras Shevchenko was reburied here on Taras Hill in May 1861.", "The Dormition Cathedral is a rare 12th-century monument built in 1144.", "The Kaniv Nature Reserve is one of the oldest in Ukraine, founded in 1923.", "The Kaniv Reservoir is one of the six major reservoirs on the Dnipro River.", "The city's current population is estimated at around 23,000 residents."],
