      en: ["The first healing mineral spring was opened in 1917.", "Nikolai Gogol published the short story collection \"Mirgorod\" in 1835.", "Myrhorod mineral water has a natural source temperature of 20 degrees Celsius.", "Home to a State Museum of Ceramics located within the local technical college.", "The Khorol River provides extensive recreational areas within the city.", "The city was established in the 16th century as a fortress against Tatar raids."],
