      en: ["Founded in 1595 as a major Cossack settlement.", "Birthplace of the legendary Cossack ataman Ivan Sirko.", "Famous for its historic glassware factory established in the 1800s.", "Home to a specialized Research Institute of Sericulture.", "A strategic railway junction located south of Kharkiv.", "Historically significant location during the Cossack eras."],
      es: ["Año de fundación: 1620", "Población: 22.000 (2021)", "Superficie: 20 km²", "Altitud: 120 m", "Número de vías férreas: 10", "Construcción de la Iglesia de la Trinidad: siglo XIX"],
