      en: ["Founded in 1840 as the settlement of Sofiivka", "Granted official city status in 1966", "Located on the strategic Zaporizhzhia-Donetsk railway line", "Distance to the regional capital Zaporizhzhia is approximately 22 km", "Historically significant for its industrial metalworking plants", "Renamed to Vilniansk in 1970 to honor the Vilnianka River"],
